Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.02,0:00:03.02,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,240)\fnArial}Q: {\fn}What do you think of {\fnArial}Satoru Gojo{\fn}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since without him, I probably\Nwould have been executed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, he's my\Nbenefactor. Technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, he's been that for\Na lot of other people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, though, I don't\Nreally know him all that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one thing I know he is, for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An idiot. Major idiot. Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's flippant, egotistical, and it goes\Nwithout saying, he's the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.63,0:01:11.14,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)\3c&H8ECEDD&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm in the middle of the\Nworld. Let's go to the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.01,0:01:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokyo, the city of\NTokyo, the city of Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go to the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love you, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one mistakes that to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walls of me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should make you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:01:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your love never.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make it so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, young man, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a god. My world's a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never know. Now, so wish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't lie there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the same way, to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are special.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.04,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 33\N{\fs30\fscy150}Shibuya Incident - Gate, Open
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the third time we've met, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you still underestimate\Nthe hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, bring it. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the ones\Nwho said not to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just touch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only targeting Jogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So his earlier declaration\Nwas just misdirection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stopped using his\Nlimitless technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he given up on\Nadjusting his technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And started focusing on compact\Nattacks using cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manipulation in a space\Nthat's filling up with humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that just means there's no\Nneed for me to slip into the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use my technique instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do domain amplification! Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't use domain amplification\Nand innate technique at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only remain safe because I use\NDomain Amplification to protect myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's operating at this level with only\Nbasic cursed energy and martial arts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you're\Nnot capable of doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is not a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's one of the incarnated\Ndeath painting wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's annoying, but he comes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you try to neutralize my\Ntechnique with your domain amplification,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stronger I'm forced\Nto maintain my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think this asparagus has the\NHow's the energy left to withstand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what I have here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Prison Realm is a living barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what Genshin was reduced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that cannot\Nbe sealed in the Prison Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So of course there are conditions\Nto sealing something in it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Prison Realm's gate is opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to keep Satoru Gojo within its\Neffective sealing range of four meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep him in there\Nfor at least one whole minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't join up with us just\Nto push that impossible task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have some kind of alternate\Nagenda you're not telling us about,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I won't let you set us up to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stakes aren't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance if it means we\Nhave to fight that thing for a full minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting heated up, Jogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we do need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let Hanami's death be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use the humans as cover and\Nfocus on hit-and-run tactics!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choso! Choso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to help,\NI swear I'll kill you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too close, not too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the best they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who can't see cursed\Nspirits have started avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If their numbers keep declining and space\Nopens up, then I can catch Volcano Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more releasing my technique\Nto lure it in like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've revealed my goal of beating\Nthem to a pulp in close combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll be an issue that\Nkeeps away and coordinates with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that death painting to unleash\Na big attack through the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To exorcise them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not time!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to have been\Nover 20 minutes by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo is still completely composed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to push him\Nmuch closer to the edge.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.95,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an8\c&H455051&\3c&HF1FFFF&\shad0}Meiji Shrine (Harajuku)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone turned into monsters, and\Nthen they all got on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told I wasn't needed\Nbecause the train was full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.47,0:10:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that he was in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone got on the\Ntrain. An eight-car train.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.12,0:10:33.03,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}An eight-car train is pulling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is pulling in please\Nwait behind the yellow
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.03,0:10:36.47,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please wait behind the yellow line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,line gojo please do not\Nlean on the platform
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.47,0:10:40.54,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please do not lean on the platform doors \Nor reach your hands or face past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doors or reach your hands past them Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me on the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move! I'm getting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's not open!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, the air smells so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smells like sweet beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's leave a few humans alive after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can release them into the\Nwoods and hunt them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I burn it down with them inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanami will get mad over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Hanami has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.06,0:12:19.00,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\fnComic Sans MS\c&H090A13&\3c&HC7D0D9&\shad0\an8\b1\fs16\move(420,60,420,90,23,689)}What...?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.02,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H75EFED&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.99,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1a&HFF&\3c&HC5E3EC&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.23,0:12:28.99,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\3c&H1EDDF0&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really can't hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patchbase, the one Nanami\Nand Yuji talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you why humans are so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, one reason anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that there are too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there are either cursed\Nspirits or cursed users above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idle Transfiguration, Soul\NMultiplicity, Body Repel!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.25,Main,Mahito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Idle Transfiguration: Soul Multiplicity.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.25,0:13:22.25,Main,Mahito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Body Repel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo isn't like Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's capable of cold logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably assumes\Nsome degree of sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is necessary as he makes\Ncertain to exercise us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with both the death counts and\Nthe number of living people rising,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the skills determining what degrees\Nacceptable will stop functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I need you to do right now, Gojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to use your infinite void to\Nkill us and all the people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can save the people\Noutside your domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're incapable of doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are only willing to\Naccept one type of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The type where people are\Nkilled by cursed spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not the type where people\Nare killed by Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ponder it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Infinite Void.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a desperate gamble on a domain\Nexpansion lasting two-tenths of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two-tenths of a second was the limit\NSatoru Gojo set purely on instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the amount of time he believed\Nnon-sorcerers could withstand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being in infinite void without becoming\Nvegetables or facing after-effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that two-tenths of a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,roughly half a year's worth of\Ninformation flowed into the brains
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the non-sorcerers and\Ntransfigured humans who were present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It rendered every one of them\Nunconscious while standing upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, all the survivors from B-5 were\Nable to return to society two months later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how limited his infinite void was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that meant the special grade\Ncursed spirit could reawaken at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So with their potential\Ncounterattack in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo narrowed his focus\Non the transfigured humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After dismissing his domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the strongest sorcerer of the\Nmodern age slaughtered all of the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,roughly 1,000 transfigured humans\Nunleashed upon B5 in 299 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:18:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prison Realm, gate open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right. Even\Nthough we do need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fake...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transformation technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a minute in Satoru Gojo's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't lose yourself in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in the midst of battle, Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't sense any cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get my body to move either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this checkmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Suguru Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body and cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the information provided by my six\Neyes is telling me you're Suguru Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let both my heart and\Nmy soul know otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now answer me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my technique, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can pass from one body to another\Nby replacing its brain with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I can also use the\Ntechniques of the body I inhabit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wanted this man's curse\Nmanipulation in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have Shoko Ieri dispose of\NSuguru Gato's body that day, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An odd time for you to show consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I was able to\Nobtain this body with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll release your seal eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, maybe a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just too strong to be let loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.81,0:20:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're in the way of my current plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think beat\Nthe crap out of that body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before I eventually\Nstepped in and killed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuta Kotsu, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't see as much\Nappeal in that boy as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Copying techniques without any conditions\Nand a bottomless well of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of those were just\Neffects obtained from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,binding the soul of his\Nmost beloved with a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.39,0:21:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say this, but Yuta\NOkkotsu could never replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, let us meet again in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.15,0:21:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.43,0:21:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Yuji Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to choose the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:22:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to make sure\Nit's hard to say it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.29,0:23:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.17,0:23:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of skin care?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.61,0:23:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're asking me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do all kinds of things, but like,\Nit ultimately comes down to genetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.01,0:23:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure those with pale,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.23,0:23:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smooth skin like Gojo would\Nsay I don't really do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.80,0:23:55.01,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Pandemonium
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.91,0:23:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.90,0:23:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, really.

